{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":64,"timestamp":"2026-07-14T04:40:19.333662746Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"1cdcd388-a982-4363-adb0-086452b9f63a","title":"Crosslink repo prerequisites: driver key, bootstrap, hub-cache signing","description":"## Crosslink Repo Prerequisites\n\nThree high-priority crosslink repo issues must be resolved before evidence-based gate wiring can begin. These are tracked here for visibility; the actual fixes belong in the crosslink repo.\n\n### #737 — driver key never added to allowed_signers, hub commits fail verification\nDriver key must be functional before crosslink trust driver-init command can work.\n\n### #738 — crosslink init bootstrap leaves no pending key (trust enforcement stuck)\nBootstrap must work correctly before bootstrap.status can gate enforcement.\n\n### #746 — repair stale hub-cache signingkey on kickoff cleanup\nSigning key reliability affects gate assumptions.\n\n## Action\nThese need fixes in the crosslink repo (not ASES). Track progress here and link to crosslink repo issues when available.\n\n## Blocks\n- Issue #22 (enforcement wiring)\n- Issue #23 (event-sig verification)\n- Issue #24 (TDD BYPASS tests may need to account for fixed behaviour)","priority":"high","created_by":"OL2r"},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEm3NuALl+o3OFaFiJcnM8l6cz/OfoEQPEKKQlSXIx/lCrY7vxxUS+b6XBqHMjOk6OSvzbkoJyqTC8JWmrp2UQ8="}
